# Terraform/Terragrunt: commit provider locks, never state or plans.
**/.terraform/*
**/.terragrunt-cache/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.plan
crash.log
crash.*.log
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
**/backend.generated.tf
**/provider.generated.tf
**/debug.tfvars
**/terragrunt-debug.tfvars.json
# Local Terragrunt overrides.
terraform/environments/**/local.hcl

# Deployment artifacts: images, digests and saved plans stay out of VCS.
dist/

# Credentials and local configuration.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.aws/

# Build/test outputs.
code/bootstrap
code/server
bin/
coverage.out
*.test
.DS_Store
